  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 21,
      "npc" : "Bossnia Staff",
      "text" : "[Riss]\nHello?\nI found some beautiful places\nwhile I travelled all over the world.\nI am an adventurer.\nHaha~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Bossnia Staff",
      "text" : "[Riss]\nWhat? My name is...\n'Bossnia Staff'?? No no...\nWell, my name is not so important.\nSometimes you should be generous.\nNo time for considering that kind of small stuff\nwhen you have to concentrate on more important things."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Bossnia Staff",
      "text" : "[Riss]\nHum... anyway I want to say... something..\nWhile I was travelling through some places,\nI found a really fearful place."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Bossnia Staff",
      "text" : "[Riss]\nMost of the time when you come to a place,\nthere is one strong and fearful monster.\nIsn't it?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Bossnia Staff",
      "text" : "[Riss]\nBut... but... in there...\nThere are lots of fearful and strong monsters in there...\nThat was really frightful."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Bossnia Staff",
      "text" : "[Riss]\nIf I had reacted a bit later... a few seconds...\nI might have been killed."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Bossnia Staff",
      "text" : "[Riss]\nWhat?\nYou want to go in there?\nOh~ Boy~ you didn't get me.\nIn there......."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Bossnia Staff",
      "text" : "[Riss]\nUh... you already know?\nAlthough you know the place, you want to go in...\nGood, I will send you there.\nBut after you went there, don't hold"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Bossnia Staff",
      "text" : "a grudge against me. It'll cost you 1 Reset Stone for 5 access."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Bossnia Staff",
      "text" : "[Riss]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
